{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md","title":"Friedberg-Muchnik Theorem","display":"thm-friedberg-muchnik — Friedberg-Muchnik Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-friedberg-muchnik","aliases":["88-thm-friedberg-muchnik"],"display":"thm-friedberg-muchnik — Friedberg-Muchnik Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-priority-method]]","[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-df-effective-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-friedberg-muchnik"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-friedberg-muchnik</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-muchnik — Friedberg-Muchnik Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e343b0f4eb4c083\" href=\"?note=8e343b0f4eb4c083\" title=\"88-df-priority-method\">88-df-priority-method</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"865c7ff37947029a\" href=\"?note=865c7ff37947029a\" title=\"88-lem-finite-injury-verification\">88-lem-finite-injury-verification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为待构造的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{e,s}\">\\(B_{e,s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\">\\(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{e,s}\">\\(B_{e,s}\\)</span> 是规则近似而不是本定理目标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的阶段近似。</li>\n<li>有限损伤运行与验证义务分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8e343b0f4eb4c083\" href=\"?note=8e343b0f4eb4c083\" title=\"88-df-priority-method\">88-df-priority-method</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"865c7ff37947029a\" href=\"?note=865c7ff37947029a\" title=\"88-lem-finite-injury-verification\">88-lem-finite-injury-verification</a>；合并双输出时使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus B\">\\(A\\oplus B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}muchnik}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\n\\land\\neg(A\\leq_TB)\\land\\neg(B\\leq_TA)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}muchnik}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\n\\land\\neg(A\\leq_TB)\\land\\neg(B\\leq_TA)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造及验证。按次序交错处理要求“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^B\">\\(\\varphi_e^B\\)</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的特征函数”和“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的特征函数”。以第一个方向为例：初始化后选择一个未用过且高于当前所有高优先级保护界的见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，暂不把它加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。逐阶段检查有限规则近似是否给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}^{B_s}(x)=0\">\\(\\varphi_{e,s}^{B_s}(x)=0\\)</span>。一旦发现，枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，并保护该计算所用的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 初段；随后不再行动，除非被更高优先级初始化。另一方向完全对称。选择见证及执行对角枚举都计为行动，以保证状态更新与优先框架一致。</p>\n<p>每阶段执行最小编号的需要注意的策略，并初始化全部较低优先级策略。所有检查只用有限输出、有限规则图和自然数计算，所以两个输出都是可计算有限集列的单调并。把双输出编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\\oplus B_s\">\\(A_s\\oplus B_s\\)</span>，可将每个有限神谕保护集转换为其最大数码加一的保护界，得到所引框架的数据。</p>\n<p>若高优先级策略最终停止行动，本策略最多再选择一次见证并执行一次对角枚举，因此满足“最终停止行动”的局部义务。最终若执行对角枚举，受保护的零输出与见证进入目标集相冲突；若始终没有执行而最终函数却是目标集的特征函数，则最终见证仍不在目标集中，应有零输出。该收敛只用有限神谕信息，所有相关位稳定后必在某个有限阶段被发现，矛盾。因此两个方向的每项局部义务都满足。有限损伤验证引理推出全部要求在最终输出上成立，得到不可比性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-priority-method","status":"resolved","id":"8e343b0f4eb4c083","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-priority-method]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-finite-injury-verification","status":"resolved","id":"865c7ff37947029a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-join","status":"resolved","id":"20e88b72affa35d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAncho