[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]；合并双输出时使用 [[88-df-effective-join]] 的 $A\\oplus B$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A","display":false},{"tex":"B_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"B_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\oplus B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}muchnik}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\n\\land\\neg(A\\leq_TB)\\land\\neg(B\\leq_TA)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{e,s}^{B_s}(x)=0","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A_s\\oplus B_s","display":false}],"bytes":2850,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-proof.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice.md]]\n[[88-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-sigma1-complete.md]]\n[[88-thm-smn.md]]\n[[88-thm-soundness.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-equals-recursive.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8e343b